   "text": "Birkbeck, University of London - Foundation - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nBirkbeck, University of London - Foundation\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nBirkbeck is a world-class research and teaching institution, a vibrant center of academic excellence and London’s only specialist provider of evening higher education. The College is situated in the heart of the University of London’s central campus, next to many other University of London Colleges, including UCL and SOAS. The central location is only minutes’ walk from the British Museum and other famous London attractions. Established in 1823, Birkbeck has a long history of offering the highest-quality university education. Foundation courses at  OnCampus London lead to a degree program at the university.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n27/03/2026 08:35\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n27/03/2026 08:35\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £24,313.00\nMin: £16,794.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n31%\n3,500 of 11,425 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nOn Campus\nFounded Year\n1823\nCampus(es)\nLondon\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n29/03/2022\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V2w4GVqzhik\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
